text = "WASD/Arrow Keys:Move
Mouse:Look Around
LMB:Shoot
RMB:Aim Down Sight
Space:Jump
Shift:Sprint
Control:Crouch
Alt:Freelook
E:Change Gun
X:Dash
N:Grapple Hook
G:Throw Grenade
B:Throw Smoke Grenade
C:Throw Flashbomb
Escape:Bring Up The InGame Menu
F11:Toggle Fullscreen"

